Package: foundryR
Title: Tidy Interface to Azure AI Foundry
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Alex", "Farach", , "alexfarach@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Provides a tidy, API-first interface to Microsoft Azure AI Foundry.
    All functions return tibbles and integrate seamlessly with tidyverse and
    tidymodels workflows. Supports chat completions, text embeddings, and
    semantic similarity operations using Azure-hosted models including GPT,
    Claude, Llama, Mistral, DeepSeek, and Cohere.
